# Renders docs/media/hr-demo.gif — run from repo root: vhs docs/media/hr-demo.tape
Output docs/media/hr-demo.gif
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1000
Set Height 620
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Type "# OpenAgentOS: payroll change pauses for human approval, with audit trail"
Enter
Type "uv run python -m apps.hr.demo 2>/dev/null"
Enter
Sleep 20s
